              <tr><td>Volatile cyclic</td><td>Cyclopentasiloxane (D5)</td><td>High — evaporates within minutes</td><td>Carrier and spreading aid; light, non-greasy sensory finish</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Non-volatile linear</td><td>Dimethicone</td><td>None — remains on the hair</td><td>Durable, glossy, lubricious long-wear film</td></tr>
